agent-transcripts
canvases
storage/reports
*.md
!README.md

# Compose / nginx live outside the image (mounted at runtime)
compose*.yaml
compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yml
docker-compose*.yaml
nginx

# Misc
.dockerignore
